        "message": "=<html> <body style='font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; color: #333;'>   <div style='background: #2c3e50; color: white; padding: 24px; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;'>     <h2 style='margin:0;'>Update on your Application: {{ $json.candidate_name }}</h2>   </div>      <div style='padding: 24px; background: #fdfdfd; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;'>     <p>Dear <strong>{{ $json.candidate_name }}</strong>,</p>          <p>Thank you for applying for the <strong>{{ $json.job_position }}</strong> position. Our team has reviewed your profile carefully.</p>          <p>While we found your background impressive, we noticed some areas where your current skills could be further aligned with our specific requirements, particularly in:</p>          <div style='background: #fff3e0; border-left: 4px solid #ff9800; padding: 12px; margin: 16px 0;'>       <p style='margin:0; color: #e65100;'><strong>Identified Skill Gaps:</strong><br>       {{ $json.gaps }}</p>     </div>      <p>However, based on our company policy and your potential, we are pleased to inform you that you have been placed in our <strong>Merit List 2 (Waitlist)</strong>.</p>          <div style='background: #e3f2fd; border-left: 4px solid #2196f3; padding: 16px; margin: 16px 0;'>       <p style='margin:0;'><strong>What this means:</strong> As soon as a seat becomes available or our next hiring phase begins, our team will reach out to you directly via mail to schedule an interview.</p>     </div>      <p>We appreciate your interest in joining us and encourage you to keep upgrading your skills in the meantime.</p>          <p>Your Submission ID: <strong>{{ $json.submission_id }}</strong></p>          <p>Best regards,<br>     <strong>HR Talent Acquisition Team</strong></p>   </div> </body> </html>",
